.git
.claude
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
e2e
infrastructure

apps/editor.planx.uk/*
!apps/editor.planx.uk/package.json
apps/hasura.planx.uk/*
!apps/hasura.planx.uk/package.json
apps/localplanning.services/*
!apps/localplanning.services/package.json
apps/postgres/*
!apps/postgres/package.json

# NB the negated package.json globs above are load-bearing: `turbo prune` needs every workspace
# member's package.json present to resolve the workspace graph against the lockfile

# host build/test artefacts - every build happens in-image, and no dist is committed
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo

# local data, scratch and docs - none are workspace members
minio-data
ignore
doc
localplanning.services
docker_compose_logs.txt
.vscode

# secrets - no Dockerfile declares an ARG or a --mount=type=secret, and compose passes env at
# runtime. (Compose's own interpolation reads the *host* .env; .dockerignore does not affect that.)
.env*
**/.env*
